<title>USA: Sullivan Dental to buy leasing company.</title>
<headline>Sullivan Dental to buy leasing company.</headline>
<dateline>WEST ALLIS, Wis. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sullivan Dental Products Inc said Thursday it will acquire the assets and assume all of the liabilities of  Omega Professional Services Inc, an equipment leasing company in Salt Lake City, Utah.</p>
<p>Omega manages dental equipment leasing operations in Utah, Idaho and Nevada, said Sullivan, processing transactions valued at $10 million annually. The company said the purchase is the first step toward establishing its own leasing unit.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not announced.</p>
<p>Sullivan Dental Products distributes dental supplies and equipment.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
